 .../PlatformHstiDxe/PlatformHstiDxe.inf       |  55 ++
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc             |   2 +
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf             |   1 +
 4 files changed, 557 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 UefiPayloadPkg/PlatformHstiDxe/PlatformHstiDxe.c
