@@ -496,6 +496,7 @@
   VarCheckLib|MdeModulePkg/Library/VarCheckLib/VarCheckLib.inf
   VariablePolicyLib|MdeModulePkg/Library/VariablePolicyLib/VariablePolicyLib.inf
